# Runtime state, rewritten every tick. The deploy serves snapshot.json, which
# is committed, timestamped and declares itself a snapshot. Shipping both would
# put two data files on a static host where only one of them is honest about
# what it is. Gitignoring this is not enough: Vercel deploys the working
# directory, not the git tree.
web/state.json
